  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ProfilePage","dateCreated":"2024-10-21T16:45:35.313Z","mainEntity":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","description":"The library for web and native user interfaces","image":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/bafkreibvieudczvr7oviy3mrrcq6fy2dpur2s4laz6iklwwtmhz4a7wcwy","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/FollowAction","userInteractionCount":18572}],"agentInteractionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/FollowAction","userInteractionCount":2},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/WriteAction","userInteractionCount":178}]},"hasPart":[{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev/post/3mfn2s5iko22q","identifier":"at://did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/app.bsky.feed.post/3mfn2s5iko22q","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev"},"text":"The React Foundation has officially launched, hosted by the Linux Foundation. Read more here: https://react.dev/blog/2026/02/24/the-react-foundation","image":["https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/bafkreifjuecplttyb4boqem3k4l3a3r2guhpkkqe5udhvbwqsx3vjk7ory"],"thumbnailUrl":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/bafkreifjuecplttyb4boqem3k4l3a3r2guhpkkqe5udhvbwqsx3vjk7ory","datePublished":"2026-02-24T21:01:18.164Z","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":143},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":2},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/ShareAction","userInteractionCount":23}],"commentCount":2},{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev/post/3m7qhaqdtxc2v","identifier":"at://did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7qhaqdtxc2v","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev"},"text":"Researchers have found two new vulnerabilities in React Server Components while attempting to exploit the patches last week.\n\nThese are new issues, separate from the critical CVE last week. The patch for React2Shell remains effective for the Remote Code Execution exploit.","datePublished":"2025-12-11T20:51:03.436Z","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":176},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":2},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/ShareAction","userInteractionCount":96}],"commentCount":2},{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev/post/3m73sgkikuc2h","identifier":"at://did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/app.bsky.feed.post/3m73sgkikuc2h","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev"},"text":"There is critical vulnerability in React Server Components disclosed as CVE-2025-55182 that impacts React 19 and frameworks that use it.\n\nA fix has been published in React versions 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1. We recommend upgrading immediately.\n\nhttps://react.dev/blog/2025/12/03/critical-security-vulnerability-in-react-server-components","datePublished":"2025-12-03T15:45:14.532Z","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":144},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":7},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/ShareAction","userInteractionCount":107}],"commentCount":7,"sharedContent":{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://react.dev/blog/2025/12/03/critical-security-vulnerability-in-react-server-components"}},{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev/post/3m73sgkikuc2h","identifier":"at://did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/app.bsky.feed.post/3m73sgkikuc2h","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev"},"text":"There is critical vulnerability in React Server Components disclosed as CVE-2025-55182 that impacts React 19 and frameworks that use it.\n\nA fix has been published in React versions 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1. We recommend upgrading immediately.\n\nhttps://react.dev/blog/2025/12/03/critical-security-vulnerability-in-react-server-components","datePublished":"2025-12-03T15:45:14.532Z","interactionStatistic":[{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":144},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":7},{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/ShareAction","userInteractionCount":107}],"commentCount":7,"sharedContent":{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://react.dev/blog/2025/12/03/critical-security-vulnerability-in-react-server-components"}},{"@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev/post/3m3dpzkk4422u","identifier":"at://did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe/app.bsky.feed.post/3m3dpzkk4422u","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"React","alternateName":"@react.dev","identifier":"did:plc:uorpbnp2q32vuvyeruwauyhe","url":"/contra-assets/react.dev"},"text":"React Conf 2025 is a wrap! Check out the recap: https://react.dev/blog/2025/10/16/react-conf-2025-recap","datePublished":"2025-10-16T21:42